 1089 "q-115519" 13194139536083 true] [17592186382731 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536083 true] [17592186382731 1100 "Evaluate ${lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1-x)-2x}{x+1}.$" 13194139536083 true] [17592186382731 1113 #uuid "2a04167c-7a25-5d39-ae6d-b1e4e325783d" 13194139536083 true] [17592186382731 1145 "Here the limits of the numerator and denominator are ${lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1-x)-2x)=\\infty $ and ${lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }(x+1)=-\\infty ,$ respectively, so we have the case $\\frac{\\infty }{-\\infty }.$\n\nApplying L'Hopital's rule, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1-x)-2x}{x+1} & ={lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }\\frac{[\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1-x)-2x]^{′}}{{[x+1]}^{′}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }\\frac{(-\\frac{1}{1-x}-2)}{1} \\\\  & =-{lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }(\\frac{1}{1-x}+2) \\\\  & =-(0+2) \\\\  & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536083 true] [17592186382732 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382733 13194139536083 true] [17592186382732 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382734 13194139536083 true] [17592186382732 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382735 13194139536083 true] [17592186382732 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382736 13194139536083 true] [17592186382732 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382737 13194139536083 true] [17592186382732 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536083 true] [17592186382732 1041 "selection" 13194139536083 true] [17592186382732 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382737 13194139536083 true] [17592186382732 1110 #uuid "bc26de5f-8ba5-5290-8c5c-e1212472baa0" 13194139536083 true] [17592186382733 1034 "\\infty " 13194139536083 true] [17592186382733 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536083 true] [17592186382733 1111 #uuid "2922593b-f08f-513a-a291-4e6e39a50861" 13194139536083 true] [17592186382734 1034 "-\\infty " 13194139536083 true] [17592186382734 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536083 true] [17592186382734 1111 #uuid "76bbb6ff-a567-53d8-a9ef-bfda58cd60c1" 13194139536083 true] [17592186382735 1034 "0" 131941